# =====================================================================
# Release V037 -- Security.Application_Users module access flags
# =====================================================================
# Adds per-module menu access booleans (Access_Home/Revenue/Patient/Schedule/
# Clinical/NHS + the not-yet-built Day_Book/Finance/My_Data/Marketing) and
# Practitioner_Full_Name to Security.Application_Users, so App menus can be gated
# per user and sold as separate subscriptions. Existing menus default ON, new
# modules OFF. MIGRATE (ALTER + seed) preserves the live rows -- the canonical
# Table.sql/Data.sql are updated to match for future full rebuilds but are NOT
# redeployed here (that would DROP/CREATE and wipe the live users).
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V037__application_users_access_flags.manifest
# =====================================================================

MIGRATE  Migrations\V037__application_users_access_flags.sql

TEST
